 ## Background
-Originated in procedural modeling of gases and fluids, as described in [S1, unofficial]. The method is similar to steam rising procedures but adapted for smoke with added helical displacement for bending and swirling [S1, unofficial]. It is used in computer graphics for simulating smoke columns in animations and visual effects.
